OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a largely cloudy day
OL,6,Fwith rain at times, this mainly light
OL,7,Fin the morning but becoming a bit
OL,8,Fheavier and more persistent in the
OL,9,Fafternoon. Quite breezy around the
OL,10,Fcoasts.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRemaining mostly cloudy with
OL,13,Ffurther rain at times, with just a few
OL,14,Fdrier clearer interludes in the far
OL,15,Fwest. Winds easing.
OL,16,
OL,17,CWednesday:FMainly cloudy with further
OL,18,Frain at times, though it will become
OL,19,Fdrier and perhaps a bit brighter later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
